	<item>
		<title>By: Robert J. Pavao</title>
		<link>http://drownedmadonna.com/5-stars-that-wouldnt-exist-without-madonna/20150817#comment-29579</link>
		<dc:creator><![CDATA[Robert J. Pavao]]></dc:creator>
		<pubDate>Wed, 19 Aug 2015 16:32:22 +0000</pubDate>
		<guid isPermaLink="false">http://drownedmadonna.com/?p=5957#comment-29579</guid>
		<description><![CDATA[Madonna has paved the way for many of today&#039;s pop princesses and is probably the biggest female artist to impact pop culture but let&#039;s not forget that before Madonna there were other female icons that may have paved the way for Madonna - Deborah Harry (Blondie), Grace Jones, Siouxsie Sioux, Tina Turner, Chrissie Hynde (The Pretenders), Stevie Nicks (Fleetwood Mac), etc.....not to downplay the impact Madonna has had.  I am a huge Madonna fan and I understand that there is no one that has the same legendary status as she does.]]></description>
		<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>Madonna has paved the way for many of today&#039;s pop princesses and is probably the biggest female artist to impact pop culture but let&#039;s not forget that before Madonna there were other female icons that may have paved the way for Madonna &#8211; Deborah Harry (Blondie), Grace Jones, Siouxsie Sioux, Tina Turner, Chrissie Hynde (The Pretenders), Stevie Nicks (Fleetwood Mac), etc&#8230;..not to downplay the impact Madonna has had.  I am a huge Madonna fan and I understand that there is no one that has the same legendary status as she does.</p>
]]></content:encoded>
	</item>
