		<pubDate>Tue, 18 Aug 2015 05:54:48 +0000</pubDate>
		<guid isPermaLink="false">http://drownedmadonna.com/?p=5957#comment-29519</guid>
		<description><![CDATA[Let&#039;s just say Madonna taking control of her own career , made it possible today FEMALE artists have control over their own career and image. Without Madonna being the first to demand it , none of today&#039;s female performers  would have the control they have to write and produce their own music, change their image, change musical direction, call their own shots, &quot;reinvent &quot; themselves. It all so normal now. It wasnt that way before Madonna. So, yes Taylor Swift owes her gratiude for opening doors for women in the industry. Taylor, Gaga and Rhiana have all followed the Madonna career blueprint knowingly or not because Madonna set that standard. They ALL want that kind of career longevity . Madonna&#039;s career is not by luck or chance. It&#039;s been through talent and hard work .....PERIOD!]]></description>
		<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>Let&#039;s just say Madonna taking control of her own career , made it possible today FEMALE artists have control over their own career and image. Without Madonna being the first to demand it , none of today&#039;s female performers  would have the control they have to write and produce their own music, change their image, change musical direction, call their own shots, &quot;reinvent &quot; themselves. It all so normal now. It wasnt that way before Madonna. So, yes Taylor Swift owes her gratiude for opening doors for women in the industry. Taylor, Gaga and Rhiana have all followed the Madonna career blueprint knowingly or not because Madonna set that standard. They ALL want that kind of career longevity . Madonna&#039;s career is not by luck or chance. It&#039;s been through talent and hard work &#8230;..PERIOD!</p>
]]></content:encoded>
